WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:19.713
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:27.007
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.007 --> 00:00:30.194
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.194 --> 00:00:34.423
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.423 --> 00:00:40.446
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.446 --> 00:00:45.825
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.825 --> 00:00:51.399
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.399 --> 00:00:57.748
At closing time, some people will not have checked themselves out.

9
00:00:57.748 --> 00:01:03.034
The In Class tile counts how many.

10
00:01:03.034 --> 00:01:08.172
This one button closes all of them.

11
00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:14.911
It says how many it will check out, so there are no surprises.

12
00:01:14.911 --> 00:01:19.910
Hold it for two seconds. A tap does nothing.

13
00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:28.560
That is deliberate — this writes a time onto several people at once.

14
00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:35.819
Everyone still in class is now checked out, at the time you held it.

15
00:01:35.819 --> 00:01:44.967
It only appears on today. A missing check-out from yesterday is an Edit Time correction.
